: 6617, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4014, "last_played": 1705084615, "avatar": "878f899bc9236c80a087ced19ae4636e435f4694"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best roguelikes on the market at the moment. A complete package, filled with dozens and dozens of hours of gameplay for casual players and presumably hundreds for the hardcore crowd. 6 different and varied characters, full-feeling skill tree, very varied and extremely fun weapons, and great individual match buffs/scrolls. One of the only games I prefer playing in co-op as well being a mainly solo player as well. For the price, pick it up if anything looks interesting about it for you. \n\nAnd people who complain about the DPS check bosses have never played a roguelike or game with alternate paths before.", "timestamp_created": 1637613630, "timestamp_updated": 1637613630, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103293159", "author": {"steamid": "76561198286469003", "personaname": "cheesestick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198286469003/", "num_games_owned": 102, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1213, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 428, "last_played": 1721714497, "avatar": "0c4e43b8a27d27fc076694deae453bb67025116b"}, "language": "english", "review": "melee is the only good way to play the game and you cannot convince me otherwise", "timestamp_created": 1637613224, "timestamp_updated": 1637613224, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103292329", "author": {"steamid": "76561198157157178", "personaname": "BIGGEST WIFE-LOVER", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/theabsolutebiggestman/", "num_games_owned": 682, "num_reviews": 132, "playtime_forever": 1107, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 674, "last_played": 1685855699, "avatar": "8cd7f9a9091ff23b8961f1c46ab22f986c271062"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's good.", "timestamp_created": 1637612234, "timestamp_updated": 1637612234, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471698105335235596", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103292062", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037365450", "personaname": "rahat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/imrahat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1460, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 419, "last_played": 1661672931, "avatar": "1c0b5c37a442a2d39f32902ec42f2e26ba6a142e"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timestamp_created": 1637611930, "timestamp_updated": 1637611930, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471698105335235596", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103291466", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036099235", "personaname": "Peaceful Mind", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jakmet/", "num_games_owned": 83, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 54591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18951, "last_played": 1788466417, "avatar": "4fc3c7352bec0f8a27b243738092f31c8248713c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game. I've been playing this game for months and I can't get enough of it! My favorite character is Lei Lou. I love using the snipers. My goal is to hit the highest single hit damage and this character is perfect for this goal. Overall this game is worth playing when you are listening to music or broadcast or anything. PS: I love the new 1.0 update. The new world and enemies are so unique and really enjoyable to play against. Great game!", "timestamp_created": 1637611199, "timestamp_updated": 1637611199, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103291317", "author": {"steamid": "76561198839148460", "personaname": "Conichutle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/stabbyduck/", "num_games_owned": 147, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 4566, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4328, "last_played": 1705126979, "avatar": "e777192909c5708f0cdb80b276d4f9ec64381529"}, "language": "english", "review": "     When I play this game, I get a similar sensation as to when I am eating Garden Salsa Sun Chips. The amazing taste and texture of a Garden Salsa Sun Chip is so good to my tongue, and like that the feeling of playing this game is so full of great texture and flavor. It is difficult to explain for the weak minded, but consuming this game is so alike consuming a Garden Salsa Sun Chip it's truly unbelievable. If you are like me and love Garden Salsa Sun Chips, I will assure you that you will love this game as well. This is the only game where I feel like I am consuming a Garden Salsa Sun Chip while playing, so it is truly speaking to me. Not only that, but I feel as if it doesn't only give me the sensation of eating Garden Salsa Sun Chips.\n     Sometimes, I honestly feel like I am also ingesting a beautifully rounded Lindor Chocolate Ball. As I have previously stated, the challenge in explaining these pleasurable experiences might result in some not fully understanding what I am saying. However, the creamy goodness and chocolaty exterior on Lindor Chocolate Balls are just wonderful for the consumer, and I can say the same for Gunfire Reborn. You may not interpret the way this game tingles my taste buds and activates my excitement. These feelings can only vaguely be explained by someone so simple minded, but not as weak as others, like me.\n     Perhaps someone of a higher level of understanding of this universe can comprehend and explain my sensations in a more advanced and understandable way for others to know how I feel. This is truly a life changing game that as I have stated earlier do not have the lexicon to project my actual passion for. Hopefully you take this review to heart before make this purchase and understand and enjoy Gunfire Reborn like me. I hope whoever reads this has a pleasant day and has as fun of a time as me.", "timestamp_created": 1637611026, "timestamp_updated": 1637611026, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519685029983520508", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103285750", "author": {"steamid": "76561198022465587", "personaname": "|lulz| Gygun", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198022465587/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1593, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 395, "last_played": 1640994697, "avatar": "342c774369644792bb456e6c601576f25ce869f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun to get an good build", "timestamp_created": 1637604424, "timestamp_updated": 1637604424, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.485771775245666504", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103284870", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067276407", "personaname": "ACan0fTuna", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067276407/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 7798, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3733, "last_played": 1753719818, "avatar": "4c193870a65aa8910556d735bb7c9338c923775f"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the most complete packages for the price since Slay the Spire. Satisfying arcade shooter with a fair amount of weapon and upgrade variety. Each stage is distinct and embodies the biome's theme as well. Only possible negative I can give is weapons do start to feel too similar once you've put enough time into it. From the sound of the devs this should be a small and short lived problem that will only get better with updates.\n\nThis team nailed what they were aiming for and it shows in every aspect of the game.", "timestamp_created": 1637603310, "timestamp_updated": 1637603310, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514228224754333496", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "103283505", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051423088", "personaname": "Ketil The Ba